# Test-id families that the Phase 6 STIC and video rules name and no suite registers yet (plan 06-01, D-23).
# One line per family prefix: `<family-prefix> <owning plan>`; a prefix is dotted and ends in a dot, and the owner is the first plan that
# registers an id of the family in data/expected/tests/*.ids. The video step requires every test entry of a rule of data/stic/rules.json
# to be a prefix of at least one registered id or a line here, and a line here whose prefix already has a registered id to be deleted
# (tokens video-rule-no-test and video-pending-stale): the owner plan deletes its lines in the same commit that registers the first id.
video.cstack. 06-11
video.mode. 06-11
runner.vchain. 06-12
runner.operator. 06-12
runner.golden. 06-12
runner.frameppm. 06-12
run.diag.stic. 06-13
